<title>USA: Lamar Advertising to buy FKM for $40 mln.</title>
<headline>Lamar Advertising to buy FKM for $40 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BATON ROUGE, La. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lamar Advertising Co said Wednesday it has signed an agreement to acquire all of the stock of FKM Advertising Inc at a cash purchase price of $40 million.</p>
<p>Lamar said FKM has a portfolio of billboards in Youngstown, Ohio and along highways throughout Pennsylvania.</p>
